.TH CREATE_CHTTPSVR 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
create_chttpsvr \- create an HTTP server with the default allocator
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <chttpserver.h>

chttpsvr create_chttpsvr(clog cl, char **err_str);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Inline wrapper for create_chttpsvr_mp with mprocs = NULL.

cl may be NULL; see create_chttpsvr_mp for the logger semantics.
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
A valid chttpsvr handle on success, or NULL on failure.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR create_chttpsvr_mp (3)
